From fdea5a4f6dfd433cd81f10c5dac105ed36932003 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ReArc Overlay <overlay@rearc.invalid>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 14:33:06 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] P-TAB-001 wave 18f: render autofill suggestions in the host

For registry tabs AutofillPopupView::Create returns a host view instead of Chromium's Views popup, so AutofillPopupControllerImpl keeps deciding when suggestions show and hide and keeps filling, previews, keyboard handling and its early-accept guard, while the host draws. Address, card, IBAN, autocomplete, datalist and password suggestions (PasswordAutofillManager uses the same ChromeAutofillClient path) reach the host with the field bounds in tab-view coordinates and rows (value, minor text, label, icon name, kind). The host accepts, previews/selects, dismisses or asks for the settings page; "Manage..." rows (ChromeAutofillClient::ShowAutofillSettings, ChromePasswordManagerClient::NavigateToManagePasswordsPage) ask the host to open chrome://settings/contactInfo, /payments, /autofill or chrome://password-manager/passwords instead of needing a Browser. Without a callback no suggestions UI is shown. ABI 1.34 / bridge 0.36.0 (autofill_suggestions); builds p83-p84, native address/card (loopback HTTPS)/password suggestions, bounds, keyboard selection, busy early accept, fills, dismiss, both manage paths and replacement pass.

Last rebased: 2026-11-04 onto Chromium 156.0.8078.74 (d331de35ca).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
